window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Jenna Deveraux will have to die to learn how to live and have a fighting chance at forging her own destiny. One carved out in blood and shrouded in death. Tonight, she will attend the ball, knowing the man of her dreams plans to ask for permission to call on her. She would be married to Trent Rathborne, the most attractive man she has ever seen and the son of a Lord. The first night of her new life.</p> <p>Everything was arranged perfectly. Fate though, had other plans. Since the moment of her conception, her future was not her own.</p> <p>Jenna will have to learn to discern friend from foe as she uncovers who and what she really is. Then, the real battle begins. Will she be capable of taking control with others conspiring against her?</p>"; 
